## About Milne Industrial
Milne Industrial supplies specialist mechanical and electrical field service engineers for critical maintenance, shutdowns, commissioning and emergency support. Its clients work in power generation, heavy industry, oil and gas, data centres, and tunnelling and mining. The business has a registered office in Cardiff and supports international projects, with project experience across Europe, the Middle East and North Africa.

## The brief
Milne Industrial provided its website design as Figma files. NC Digital was responsible for developing those designs into a responsive one-page website, adding a bespoke application form submission and hosting the finished site.

## What we built
We translated the supplied Figma layouts into a working website for desktop, tablet and mobile. The single-page structure brings together Milne's services, sectors, company background, global operations, careers and contact information.

- An opening banner introducing Milne Industrial's precision engineering work
- A services section covering compressors, pumps and valves, generators, gas and steam turbines, emergency response and data centre support
- A company introduction focused on engineering and field experience
- A global operations section showing the business's international presence
- Responsive layouts for desktop, tablet and mobile screens
- A bespoke application form submission for people applying to work with Milne

## Project cost and hosting
The project cost was under £500. Milne supplied the Figma designs, and NC Digital handled development and the bespoke application form. We also host the website. This is the cost of this particular project; pricing for other websites depends on the scope and requirements.

## A closer look
The four mockups show different sections of the homepage: the opening banner on desktop, services on a laptop, the company introduction on mobile, and global operations across desktop and mobile. Select an image to view it in full.

## Our role
Milne Industrial supplied the design. NC Digital delivered the website development, bespoke application form submission and hosting. The finished site gives prospective clients a single place to explore Milne's capabilities and provides an application route for engineers interested in working with the business.

